# sentence_id = 3
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = Blessed be the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, who according to his great mercy has caused us to be born again to a living hope through the resurrection of Jesus Christ from the dead, to an inheritance that is imperishable, undefiled, and unfading, kept in the heavens for you, who are guarded by God's power through faith for a salvation ready to be revealed in the last time.
# literal_translation = Blessed [be] the God and Father of our Lord Jesus Christ, the [one] who according to his great mercy having-begotten-again us into a living hope through [the] resurrection of Jesus Christ from [the] dead, into an inheritance imperishable and undefiled and unfading, having-been-kept in [the] heavens for you, the [ones] being-guarded in [the] power of God through faith for a salvation ready to be revealed in [the] last time.
