# sentence_id = 4
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = In this you rejoice greatly, even though now for a little while, if it must be, you have been grieved by various trials, so that the tested genuineness of your faith—more precious than gold that perishes, though it is tested by fire—may be found to result in praise and glory and honor at the revelation of Jesus Christ.
# literal_translation = In which you rejoice, a little now, if it is necessary, having been grieved in various trials, in order that the tested-genuineness of you of the faith, more precious than gold, the perishing [gold], but through fire being tested, may be found unto praise and glory and honor in [the] revelation of Jesus Christ.
