# sentence_id = 82
# translation_lang = en
# prose_translation = So I exhort the elders among you, as a fellow elder and a witness of the sufferings of Christ, and a partaker also of the glory that is about to be revealed: shepherd the flock of God that is among you, not under compulsion but willingly, not for shameful gain but eagerly, not domineering over those allotted to your charge but becoming examples to the flock.
# literal_translation = Elders therefore among you I exhort, [I] the fellow-elder and witness of the sufferings of Christ, the [one who is] also a partaker of the glory that is about to be revealed: shepherd the flock of God [that is] among you, not by compulsion but willingly, nor for shameful gain but eagerly, nor as domineering over the allotted portions but becoming examples of the flock.
